 from its date, oldest first (one recorded as none is null); then the review threshold in force on the sheet's today, as text with two decimals, null when there is none. */
    public record SettingsView(String clerkLimit, String floor, String cap, int terms, Map<String, Integer> gradeTerms, String latePct, LocalDate policyDate,
